		(property "Review Notes" "Permanent NMJ minimum-load resistor across filtered -15V and ISO_RET. Changed 4.3k to 3.6k for low-voltage margin. 4.17mA and 0.0625W at 15V. At +1% resistance, draws at least 3.3mA when rail magnitude >=12.00V (before TCR). Do not count this current as available external load. Verify both rails at minimum input and maximum load; check thermal derating."
